      "nl_krakatoa": "Krakatoa eruption (1883)",
      "nl_krakatoa_notes": "Possibly loudest sound in modern history. Heard 3000 miles away.",
      "nl_mower": "Lawn mower",
      "nl_mower_notes": "85 dB = OSHA action level (hearing conservation required).",
