      "plain_n3_sws_explanation": "Slow waves are a feature used in recognizing deep non-REM sleep. They do not measure intelligence or absence of activity.",
      "plain_n3_sws_idea": "Deep non-REM sleep includes prominent slow waves in brain recordings.",
      "plain_n3_sws_question": "A sleep recording contains a period of prominent slow waves. Which interpretation fits?",
