      "bridge_inspection_structural_health_mo": "🔍 Bridge inspection + Structural Health Monitoring (SHM)",
      "bridge_motion_is_becoming_perceptible_": "Bridge motion is becoming perceptible. Some pedestrians are unconsciously adjusting their gait. If more people arrive or stay, locked synchronization will develop.",
      "bridge_readiness_visual": "Bridge readiness visual",
      "bridge_type_depends_on_span_environmen": "Bridge type depends on span, environment, material, and budget. Engineers pick the right form for the constraints — not a favorite.",
      "bridge_types": "Bridge Types",
      "bridge_weight_kn": "Bridge weight (kN)",
      "bridges_in_extreme_environments": "🌡️ Bridges in extreme environments",
      "bridges_in_seismic_zones_are_designed_": "지반 진동이 교량에 어떻게 전달되는지, 그리고 엔지니어가 힘·움직임·손상을 어떻게 관리하는지 탐구해 보세요. 구조물과 부지에 따라 적합한 전략이 다릅니다.",
      "brief_failed": "Redesign needed",
