      "truss_desc": "삼각형으로 이루어진 뼈대 구조입니다. 삼각형은 부재가 부러지지 않는 한 모양이 변하지 않으므로 트러스는 단단합니다. 하중은 부재 축을 따라 인장력이나 압축력으로 전달되며 휨은 거의 생기지 않습니다.",
      "try_it_free": "Try it free: ",
      "tunnel_boring_machine_tbm": "Tunnel Boring Machine (TBM)",
      "tunnels_are_the_siblings_of_bridges_in": "Tunnels are the siblings of bridges in transportation engineering — used to cross when going OVER won't work. They share many fundamentals (forces, fatigue, foundations) + have their own demanding specifics (ventilation, fire safety, hydrostatic pressure, ground behavior). Understanding tunnels alongside bridges gives the full picture of how engineers move people + freight across geographical obstacles.",
