      "anchovy_populations_boom_bust_on_30_ye": "Anchovy numbers boom and bust as ocean conditions change. In the Pacific, anchovy and sardine populations swing over several decades. These swings affect seabirds, marine mammals and fisheries.",
      "ancient_lineage_still_evolving": "Ancient lineage, still evolving",
