      "following_major_opposition_from_compas": "Nueva Pescanova withdrew its application to build a commercial octopus farm at the La Esfinge dock in Gran Canaria's main port, about five years after the case was opened in May 2021. The company cited business and regulatory reasons. Compassion in World Farming, Eurogroup for Animals and other groups had opposed the plan.",
      "following_the_birch_et_al_2021_lse_rep": "After an independent LSE review found strong scientific evidence that cephalopod molluscs and decapod crustaceans are sentient, the UK government added them to its Animal Welfare (Sentience) Bill. The Animal Welfare (Sentience) Act 2022 received Royal Assent on 28 April 2022.",
