      "antibiotic_dose_model_limit": "In this model, increasing dose lowers survival more strongly for susceptible cells. Real dose-response and resistance selection depend on the drug, organism, exposure, and prescribed regimen.",
      "antibiotic_exactly_as_directed_actions": "Use antibiotics only when prescribed, take them exactly as directed, and do not share or save them. Antibiotics do not treat viral infections. Ask the prescriber before changing or stopping a regimen.",
