      "maine_211_call_211_connects_to_local_m": "Maine 211 (call 211) connects to local mental-health services. Maine Behavioral Healthcare has crisis services statewide. NAMI Maine: ",
      "maine_academy_of_nutrition_and_dieteti": "Maine Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics ",
