      "stoop_inspector_title": "Freeze a moment in the fall",
      "stoop_model_note": "A vertical fall from rest with constant air density, drag coefficient and frontal area. No flapping, lift, wind or pull-up is modeled. The speed approaches terminal as drag approaches weight.",
