      "95_ft": "95 ft",
      "9_scenarios_across_3_difficulty_tiers_": "위에서 내려다보는 훈련 차량으로 진행하는 9가지 실습 훈련입니다. 표준 평행 주차부터 시작하세요. 선택한 도로 차량은 이 훈련기에 영향을 주지 않습니다.",
      "9_universal_pillars_every_driver_must__2": "9 universal pillars every driver must know.",
      "a_0_08_bac_legal_limit_for_adults_adds": "This simulator adds ~280 ms as a teaching model for impaired reaction. NHTSA lists reaction-time impairment at .08 BAC; at 55 mph, even a few tenths of a second can add car lengths before braking starts.",
      "a_130_lb_teenager_drops_below_maine_s_": "One 12-oz beer can leave a teen above Maine's under-21 0.00 standard for hours. Food, fatigue, and body composition shift the curve — you can't reliably \"feel\" your BAC.",
      "a_1500kg_car_at_100_km_h_vs_5000kg_tru": "A 1500kg car at 100 km/h vs 5000kg truck at 50 km/h — which stops sooner?",
      "a_2_minute_structured_eval_you_ride_al": "A 2-minute structured eval. You ride along, tap to mark mistakes, get a clear coaching priority at the end.",
      "a_3d_driving_simulator_built_for_teen_": "A 3D driving simulator built for teen learners in Maine and beyond. Free, private, and offline-capable. No account needed.",
      "a_4_minute_scored_exam_modeled_on_the_": "A 4-minute scored exam modeled on the Maine BMV road test. 100 pts — 90+ passes.",
      "a_calm_ai_coach_gives_one_specific_tip": "— a calm AI coach gives one specific tip every ~30s during drives",
      "a_car_behind_you_appears_in_the_rearvi": "A car behind you appears in the rearview mirror first. As it moves to pass, it enters the side mirror BEFORE it leaves the rearview. As it leaves the side mirror, it enters your peripheral vision. No gap = no blind spot.",
      "a_car_length_10_ft_6": "About 4 car lengths (a sedan is ~15 ft)",
      "a_child_runs_out_from_between_parked_c": "A child runs out from between parked cars chasing a ball.",
      "a_clogged_air_filter_reduces_mpg_by_2_": "A clogged air filter reduces MPG by 2-10% and can reduce engine power.",
      "a_cyclist_swerves_into_your_lane_to_av": "A cyclist swerves into your lane to avoid a pothole.",
      "a_deer_appears_at_the_edge_of_the_road": "A deer appears at the edge of the road in your headlights.",
      "a_door_opens_on_a_parked_car_just_as_y": "A door opens on a parked car just as you approach.",
      "a_dui_can_raise_rates_for_7_10_years_a": "• A DUI can raise rates for 7-10 years and may cause policy cancellation",
      "a_focused_drill_headlights_sign_readin": "A focused drill. Headlights, sign reading, and scanning for what the dark hides.",
      "a_follow_me_pilot_car_leads_traffic_th": "A \"FOLLOW ME\" pilot car leads traffic through a single-lane section where traffic alternates direction. Passing the pilot puts you head-on with opposing traffic waiting their turn.",
      "a_full_football_field": "A full football field",
      "a_full_grown_moose_weighs_800_1_400_lb": "A full-grown moose weighs about 1,000 lb. Its mass sits on long legs — your bumper takes the legs out and the body comes through the windshield. Roof-crush is the usual cause of death, not the impact itself.",
      "a_moving_violation_conviction_during_i": "An intermediate-license restriction violation extends your passenger, curfew, and device restrictions by another 270 days. It can also mean a $250-$500 fine and license suspension.",
