      "every_year_roadside_workers_and_respon": "Every year roadside workers and responders die on Maine shoulders because drivers don't move over. The law exists because \"rubbernecking at 65 mph\" kills people.",
      "everyone_out_run_at_a_45_angle_toward_": "Everyone OUT. Run away from the tracks at a 45° angle, TOWARD the oncoming train. Debris from an impact launches FORWARD in the train's direction of travel — running toward the train puts you behind the debris field.",
