      "maine_0_02_bac_zero_tolerance_implied_": "Maine under-21 0.00 zero-tolerance, implied consent, Rx + marijuana rules.",
      "maine_0_08_bac_for_21_zero_tolerance_0": "Maine: 0.08 BAC for 21+. Zero tolerance — no alcohol level over 0.00 — for under-21/provisional drivers. For commercial drivers, 0.04. Any measurable alcohol under 21 can trigger suspension.",
      "maine_2054_a_when_passing_a_stopped_em": "Maine §2070(8): when passing a stationary disabled or flashing-light vehicle, move to a non-adjacent lane if possible. If not, pass at a careful and prudent speed reasonable for safety. Violating it carries a minimum $275 fine.",
      "maine_2081_age_weight_height": "§2081 age/weight/height rules",
      "maine_2396_b_requires_a_clear_view_thr": "메인주 법 §2093은 등록 중량 10,000 lb 미만 차량에서 눈이나 얼음이 떨어지지 않도록 합리적인 조치를 취할 것을 요구합니다(대형 트럭은 제거가 현실적으로 어려워 면제). 떨어진 눈·얼음이 실제로 피해나 부상을 일으키면 교통 위반이 되며 초범 최대 50달러, 재범 이후 150~250달러의 벌금이 부과됩니다. 가장 안전한 습관은 운전 전에 지붕, 유리창, 전조등, 보닛을 모두 치우는 것입니다. 주행 중 지붕의 눈덩이가 앞유리로 미끄러지면 시야가 순식간에 가려집니다.",
      "maine_70_hour_supervised_driving_progr": "Maine 70-hour supervised driving progress",
      "maine_bmv_permit_test": "Maine Permit Practice Test",
      "maine_bmv_permit_test_condensed_key_po": "Maine BMV Permit Test · Condensed key points",
      "maine_bmv_road_test_starts_with_a_brie": "Maine BMV road test starts with a brief vehicle inspection. Examiners will check that signals, brakes, horn, wipers, and seat belts work. Failing this means the test is over before you even drive. Build the habit now.",
      "maine_gdl_learner_s_permit_at_15_w_dri": "Maine GDL: Learner's Permit at 15 with driver's ed for applicants under 18. Intermediate License at 16 after holding the permit 6+ months and logging 70 supervised hours. Passenger, curfew, and device restrictions last 270 days and can extend if violated.",
      "maine_gdl_tracker": "Maine GDL Tracker",
