      "extreme_repeatability_every_weld_looks": "Extreme repeatability. Every weld looks identical. Faster than manual for high-volume work. Less skill required to operate than to manually weld. Comprehensive data logging for quality audit.",
      "extremely_hard_brittle_the_villain_of_": "Extremely hard + brittle. The villain of welding.",
