      "production_welding_is_mentally_repetit": "Production welding is mentally repetitive. Brain wants stimulation. Common coping: podcasts on Bluetooth bone-conduction headphones (compatible with hood), planning side projects in head, social conversation during breaks. Some welders take additional certifications (CWI inspector path) to add intellectual variety.",
