      "radiation_safety": "⚠ Radiation safety",
      "radioactive_isotopes_ir_192_se_75_co_6": "Radioactive isotopes (Ir-192, Se-75, Co-60) emit gamma rays continuously. Used in field for pipeline + remote work. Source MUST be shielded — radiation incidents have killed pipeline workers.",
      "radiographic_rt": "☢ Radiographic (RT)",
