      "requires_couplant_gel_oil_so_messy_sur": "Requires couplant (gel/oil) so messy. Surface must be smooth. Highly skilled operator needed. Complex geometries (T-joints, intersections) tricky. Doesn't produce permanent record (unlike RT).",
