      "shielding_gas_mixes_what_to_use_for_wh": "💨 Shielding gas mixes — what to use for what",
      "shielding_gas_protects_the_molten_weld": "Shielding gas protects the molten weld pool from atmospheric oxygen + nitrogen. The wrong gas = porosity + poor penetration + bad arc characteristics.",
      "shielding_gases": "💨 Shielding gases",
      "shielding_gases_argon_co2_displace_oxy": "Shielding gases (argon, CO2) DISPLACE oxygen — silent killer. Heavier-than-air gases pool in low spots. Fume + ozone accumulate fast. Sparks can ignite trapped vapors.",
      "shift_work_common_in_production_shops": "Shift work common in production shops",
      "ship_hull_certified_minimal_margin_for": "Ship-hull certified — minimal margin for error, fastest travel.",
      "ships_in_a_future_weldlab_phase": "Ships in a future WeldLab phase.",
      "shipyards_biw_washburn_doughty_bigger_": "Shipyards (BIW, Washburn & Doughty) = bigger crews, structured shifts, union, strict code work. Boatyards = smaller crews, more creative latitude, often non-union, more variety per project. Both pay well. Personality fit matters as much as skill fit.",
      "shop_arithmetic": "🧮 Shop arithmetic",
      "shop_arithmetic_the_daily_math": "🧮 Shop arithmetic — the daily math",
      "shop_labor_60_95_hr_maine_2026_field_m": "Shop labor: $60-95/hr (Maine, 2026). Field/mobile work: $85-125/hr + truck charge. Repair welding (often emergencies): premium. Don't underprice — your equipment + skill + insurance cost real money. Track time honestly: first hour on every job is usually setup + parts diagnosis.",
