      "car2_fit_q2": "2. How much school can you imagine doing?",
      "car2_fit_q3": "3. Where do you want to work?",
      "car2_fit_rule": "How the ranking works: a goal match is worth 3 points, a school match 2 and a workplace match 2 (7 at most). Equal points go to the profile whose matching tags are more exclusive (it lists fewer other answers to that question); if that is equal too, alphabetical order decides. Nothing is left to chance.",
      "car2_fit_score": "match: {value1}/7",
