      "cons10_difference": "{value1} percentage points (B − A)",
      "cons10_intro": "Choose two listed mixtures and one component. Both bars start at zero on the same percentage scale. You can choose the same recipe twice to see a zero difference.",
      "cons10_mixture": "Listed mixture",
      "cons10_note": "Composition comparison of this lesson’s eight listed recipes. An unlisted component is shown as 0% here. A percentage-point difference compares component shares; it does not measure shielding performance.",
