      "cons8_source_miller": "Miller · tungsten identification and preparation",
      "cons8_teacher_preparation_r2": "How do electrode type and power source affect tungsten preparation, and why should you check the electrode and machine manufacturer’s instructions?",
      "cons8_title": "Inspect the paint, read the box",
      "cons8_tungsten_preparation_r2": "Tungsten preparation depends on the electrode and power source. Grinding marks should run lengthwise along the electrode. Modern inverter AC TIG can use a pointed or truncated electrode instead of a pre-balled tip. Follow the electrode and machine manufacturer’s preparation instructions, including how to handle contaminated tungsten.",
