      "hi4_note": "These paired sections use the existing classroom bead model. Both sections use the same plate and drawing scale. The full model penetration is listed; the section stops at the bottom of the plate. Equal transferred heat input gives equal penetration in this simplified model, while width and cap height can differ. This comparison does not establish equivalent welds or procedures, recommend settings, or predict real weld performance. Readouts are rounded; calculations and geometry retain unrounded values.",
