      "highest_mn_si_content_best_for_rusty_d_r2": "The most manganese and silicon of the common ER70S wires. Handles mill scale and light surface rust and wets out into a smooth bead, which makes it the default general-purpose MIG wire (autobody included). Still clean the joint: no wire fixes heavy rust, paint or zinc coating.",
