      "pipe2_bend_face_btn": "Face bend",
      "pipe2_bend_face_txt": "The weld FACE (cap side) is on the outside of the bend, so it is stretched. It opens up lack of fusion at the toes and between the top passes, undercut, and porosity near the surface.",
      "pipe2_bend_fails_title": "What fails a bend test",
