      "pipe2_bend_root_btn": "Root bend",
      "pipe2_bend_root_txt": "The ROOT side is stretched. It opens up incomplete penetration, unfused root edges and suck-back: the root pass is on trial.",
      "pipe2_bend_rule": "D1.1 is commonly cited as rejecting any crack or other open discontinuity over 1/8 in. (3 mm) measured in any direction on the stretched surface. The code also caps the total of the smaller ones and treats corner cracks separately, so verify against the current edition.",
