      "proc3_intro": "Compare the same role in two cutaways. The highlighted part numbers can differ; the question stays the same. Choose the first process with the cards above.",
      "proc3_joint_question": "What does the process leave behind?",
      "proc3_metal_question": "Where does the joining metal come from?",
      "proc3_note": "These are schematic process roles, not a timing sequence or a welding procedure. Spot welding highlights the sheets and internal nugget because it adds no filler and uses no shielding gas.",
      "proc3_open": "⇄ Compare two cutaways by role",
