      "proc4_inspect": "Inspect this score ↓",
      "proc4_ledger_intro": "Select a process to trace its points back to the job choices. Every total uses the same scale; an exclusion keeps a process out even when its other choices earn points.",
      "proc4_legend": "Solid bars add points; dashed bars remove points. Dashed subtotal bars belong to ruled-out processes. These are classroom comparison points, not measured weld quality. Selecting a score does not change the job or a guide answer.",
