      "side_by_side_card_matrix_typical_use_m_r2": "Look inside seven processes (MIG, TIG, Stick, both flux-cores, oxy-fuel, resistance spot) with labelled cutaways. Set up a job in the Job Matcher and watch them re-rank, with the reason for every move. Then predict the process for eight real jobs before the answer shows.",
      "side_by_side_card_matrix_typical_use_m_r3": "Look inside seven welding processes, then compare two cutaways through one shared question: heat, joining metal, protection or the finished joint. Set up a job to see the processes re-rank with reasons, then predict the process for eight real jobs.",
      "side_by_side_card_matrix_typical_use_m_r4": "Look inside seven welding processes and compare two cutaways through heat, joining metal, protection or the finished joint. Set up a job, inspect its ranked scores and select a process to see every factor that adds points, takes them away or rules it out. Predict the process for eight real jobs.",
