      "ex_vision_fluorescence_help": "Illustrative blue-light fluorescence on living coral. The glow colors are educational, not measurements of these species.",
      "ex_vision_fluorescence_science": "Fluorescent pigments absorb light and emit it at longer, visible wavelengths. Researchers can use blue lights and filters to reveal this glow. Fluorescence needs illumination; bioluminescence is light made by a chemical reaction.",
