      "mo_scenarios": "Scenarios",
      "mo_sens": "How quickly the corals die in a heatwave",
      "mo_sens_note": "Scientists do not agree on one number here. Shallow Great Barrier Reef corals died fast in 2016; NOAA's alert levels describe slower losses for a mix of corals. Try both and see how much the answer depends on it.",
